# {{ .Project }}

Headless domain-model (dm-tier) project generated with aspgen's --context/--arch
engine. Aggregates, value objects, domain services, repositories, and events
live in these class libraries; no UI/host is attached yet (`aspgen add ui` is
not implemented yet).

Layers: DomainModel, Application, Infrastructure, Persistence, Resources.

## Build

From the generated project root:

```powershell
dotnet restore .\{{ .Project }}.sln
dotnet build .\{{ .Project }}.sln
```

## CI / production build

`.\scripts\ci.ps1` runs restore, build, and test in one step (skip tests with
`-SkipTests`, override configuration with `-Configuration Debug`):

```powershell
.\scripts\ci.ps1
```

Add aggregates to the initial bounded context, or add another context:

```powershell
aspgen add aggregate Product name:string price:decimal active:bool --context {{ .Namespace }} --project .
aspgen add context Billing --arch dm --project .
```
